ared hash infrastructure -- HashConfig, DigestFiles, FormatGNU, ComputeDigest)\n      - cmd/md5sum/main.go (reference pattern for hashutil-based checksum utility)\n      - cmd/sha256sum/main.go (second reference for checksum utility structure)\n      - pkg/sys/sigpipe.go (InstallSIGPIPEHandler)\n      - CLAUDE.md (project conventions and build instructions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/b2sum/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: BLAKE2b checksum utility using pkg/hashutil\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd076 R1.1 as specified in the SRD -- core BLAKE2b digest computation for file arguments using pkg/hashutil.DigestFiles with a HashConfig wrapping the BLAKE2b hash constructor\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd076 R1.2 as specified in the SRD -- read from stdin when no file arguments are provided, using the '-' filename convention consistent with other checksum utilities\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd076 R1.3 as specified in the SRD -- output digest in the correct default format via pkg/hashutil formatting functions\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd076 R1.4 as specified in the SRD -- support binary and text mode flags for input mode selection\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per project convention\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Use pkg/hashutil.HashConfig with NewHash set to the BLAKE2b constructor and DigestLen set per the SRD default digest length -- delegate all digest computation to pkg/hashutil\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Delegate file iteration and output formatting to pkg/hashutil.DigestFiles -- do not reimplement digest computation or output formatting in cmd/b2sum\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"Follow the same flag parsing and main() structure as cmd/md5sum/main.go and cmd/sha256sum/main.go\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build -o bin/b2s